    n "你也许会说：万一波动巨大到占据了这条线的大半呢？{size=-8}{color=#999999} You might say, but what if the fluctuation is so massive, it encompasses most of that line?{/color}{/size}"

# game/ep2d6.rpy:26
translate chinese ep2d6_fab09027:

    # extend " What if the shift is so monumental, it can’t be ignored even when viewed from outer space?"
    extend " 假如偏移如此剧烈，从外太空都清晰可见呢？{size=-8}{color=#999999} What if the shift is so monumental, it can’t be ignored even when viewed from outer space?{/color}{/size}"

# game/ep2d6.rpy:27
translate chinese ep2d6_c101c2e8:

    # extend "\n\nEasy."
